  "description": "Watercolor Summer Beach Clipart.\nSummer clipart set with hand drawn colorful summer essentials: beach umbrella, ball, flip-flops, bikini and swimsuits, sun glasses, swim tube, sand castle, sea shell, sun lounger chair, straw hat, beach bag and others. Use these beach holiday illustrtions for unique summer vacation design. Combine watercolor background sand and water textures with beach PNG elements or use the pre-made compositions for your beach fashion ideas.\nBeach vacation digital watercolor clipart will be great for invitations, cards, gift tags, scrapbook, planner stickers, sublimation printing and many others. High quality downloadable summer PNG clip arts.\n________________________________\n***What you will get***\n1 ZIP-file includes:\n◼ 28 DIGITAL CLIPARTS:\n-22 Individual Elements;\n-3 Watercolor Textures;\n-3 Pre-made Compositions.\nFormat: PNG with transparent background,\nSize: Clipart: approx. 1700 x 3600 px., 880 x 2200 px., 2800 x 3900 px., 1800 x 1800 px., 1600 x 700 px., 2900 x 3300 px. (for comparison on the 2nd preview: umbrella is 2808 x 3938 px.)\nTextures: approx. 5800 x 2100 px., 4300 x 3200 px., 5000 x 2000 px.\nPre-made comositions: approx. 3600 x 2500 px., 3600 x 3500 px.\nResolution: 300 DPI.\n_______________________________\nPlease note that fonts, text, mockups, photos and preview scenes are not included. They are for demonstration purpose only.\nThis is a digital download, no physical item will be sent.\n***\n▪ All files are high resolution 300 DPI, RGB color space.\n▪ All PNG files have transparent background.\n▪ Colors may slightly vary due to monitor or printer settings. Hence, the colors on the screen may not exactly match the colors on the printout.\nPlease feel free to contact me if you have any questions. I’d be happy to help you.\nThank you. And have a nice day!\nOlya Haifisch",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Watercolor Summer Beach Clipart.<br>\nSummer clipart set with hand drawn colorful summer essentials: beach umbrella, ball, flip-flops, bikini and swimsuits, sun glasses, swim tube, sand castle, sea shell, sun lounger chair, straw hat, beach bag and others. Use these beach holiday illustrtions for unique summer vacation design. Combine watercolor background sand and water textures with beach PNG elements or use the pre-made compositions for your beach fashion ideas.<br>\nBeach vacation digital watercolor clipart will be great for invitations, cards, gift tags, scrapbook, planner stickers, sublimation printing and many others. High quality downloadable summer PNG clip arts.<br>\n________________________________<br>\n***What you will get***<br>\n1 ZIP-file includes:</p>\n<p>◼ 28 DIGITAL CLIPARTS:<br>\n-22 Individual Elements;<br>\n-3 Watercolor Textures;<br>\n-3 Pre-made Compositions.</p>\n<p>Format: PNG with transparent background,<br>\nSize: Clipart: approx. 1700 x 3600 px., 880 x 2200 px., 2800 x 3900 px., 1800 x 1800 px., 1600 x 700 px., 2900 x 3300 px. (for comparison on the 2nd preview: umbrella is 2808 x 3938 px.)<br>\nTextures: approx. 5800 x 2100 px., 4300 x 3200 px., 5000 x 2000 px.<br>\nPre-made comositions: approx. 3600 x 2500 px., 3600 x 3500 px.<br>\nResolution: 300 DPI.<br>\n_______________________________<br>\nPlease note that fonts, text, mockups, photos and preview scenes are not included. They are for demonstration purpose only.<br>\nThis is a digital download, no physical item will be sent.</p>\n<p>***<br>\n▪ All files are high resolution 300 DPI, RGB color space.<br>\n▪ All PNG files have transparent background.<br>\n▪ Colors may slightly vary due to monitor or printer settings. Hence, the colors on the screen may not exactly match the colors on the printout.</p>\n<p>Please feel free to contact me if you have any questions. I’d be happy to help you.<br>\nThank you. And have a nice day!<br>\nOlya Haifisch</p>",
